<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:modeler="http://camunda.org/schema/modeler/1.0" xmlns:camunda="http://camunda.org/schema/1.0/bpmn" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_codeConfirm" targetNamespace="http://bpmn.io/schema/bpmn" exporter="bpmn-tool" exporterVersion="1.3.0" modeler:executionPlatform="Camunda Platform" modeler:executionPlatformVersion="7.15.0">
  <bpmn:process id="codeConfirm" name="버전 확정" isExecutable="true">
    <bpmn:documentation>codeConfirm — 마루 코드 버전 확정 (To-Be only 신규 화면. As-Is 레거시 없음).
정본: docs/mdm/tasks/TSK-06-05/design.md §6.5·§6.6

action=search   -&gt; searchTask   (codeConfirmService.search)    READ
action=view     -&gt; viewTask     (codeConfirmService.view)      READ
action=validate -&gt; validateTask (codeConfirmService.validate)  EDIT — 확정 검사 10행, 쓰기 없음
action=confirm  -&gt; confirmTask  (codeConfirmService.confirm)   CONFIRM — DRAFT→RELEASED(공통 VersionStateService)</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="start" name="시작">
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_to_gw</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="actionGateway" name="action 분기">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="input" value="action" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_to_gw</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_search</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_view</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_validate</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_confirm</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="searchTask" name="확정 대기 목록 조회" camunda:class="codeConfirmService">
      <bpmn:documentation>design.md §6.5 — MDM 원천이고 DRAFT 가 있는 마루 코드의 DRAFT 목록(ID·ver 순). READ.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="search" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.dmc.codeConfirm.dto.CodeConfirmSearchRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_search</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_search_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="endSearch" name="조회 완료">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_search_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="viewTask" name="확정 대상 버전 조회" camunda:class="codeConfirmService">
      <bpmn:documentation>design.md §6.5 — 헤더(계산 상태)·대상 버전·직전 RELEASED·diff·카테고리 요약·serverNow. READ.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="view" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.dmc.codeConfirm.dto.CodeConfirmViewRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_view</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_view_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="endView" name="조회 완료">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_view_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="validateTask" name="확정 검사" camunda:class="codeConfirmService">
      <bpmn:documentation>design.md §6.5 — 검사 10행(3항은 ApplyFromOrderCheck 로 덮음, D3). 쓰기 없음. EDIT.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="validate" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.dmc.codeConfirm.dto.CodeConfirmValidateRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_validate</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_validate_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="endValidate" name="검사 완료">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_validate_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="confirmTask" name="버전 확정" camunda:class="codeConfirmService">
      <bpmn:documentation>design.md §6.5 — 담당자 가드 → VersionStateService.confirm(DRAFT→RELEASED·직전 닫기·CREATED→INUSE) 한 트랜잭션. CONFIRM.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="confirm" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.dmc.codeConfirm.dto.CodeConfirmRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_confirm</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_confirm_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="endConfirm" name="확정 완료">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_confirm_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_to_gw" sourceRef="start" targetRef="actionGateway" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_search" name="search" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="searchTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_search_end" sourceRef="searchTask" targetRef="endSearch" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_view" name="view" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="viewTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_view_end" sourceRef="viewTask" targetRef="endView" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_validate" name="validate" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="validateTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_validate_end" sourceRef="validateTask" targetRef="endValidate" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_confirm" name="confirm" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="confirmTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_confirm_end" sourceRef="confirmTask" targetRef="endConfirm" />
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="BPMNDiagram_1">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="BPMNPlane_1" bpmnElement="codeConfirm">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="start_di" bpmnElement="start">
        <dc:Bounds x="152" y="277" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="actionGateway_di" bpmnElement="actionGateway" isMarkerVisible="true">
        <dc:Bounds x="245" y="270" width="50" height="50" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="searchTask_di" bpmnElement="searchTask">
        <dc:Bounds x="380" y="60" width="100" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="endSearch_di" bpmnElement="endSearch">
        <dc:Bounds x="560" y="82" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="viewTask_di" bpmnElement="viewTask">
        <dc:Bounds x="380" y="190" width="100" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="endView_di" bpmnElement="endView">
        <dc:Bounds x="560" y="212" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="validateTask_di" bpmnElement="validateTask">
        <dc:Bounds x="380" y="320" width="100" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="endValidate_di" bpmnElement="endValidate">
        <dc:Bounds x="560" y="342" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="confirmTask_di" bpmnElement="confirmTask">
        <dc:Bounds x="380" y="450" width="100" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="endConfirm_di" bpmnElement="endConfirm">
        <dc:Bounds x="560" y="472" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_to_gw_di" bpmnElement="flow_to_gw">
        <di:waypoint x="188" y="295" />
        <di:waypoint x="245" y="295" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_search_di" bpmnElement="flow_search">
        <di:waypoint x="270" y="270" />
        <di:waypoint x="270" y="100" />
        <di:waypoint x="380" y="100" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_search_end_di" bpmnElement="flow_search_end">
        <di:waypoint x="480" y="100" />
        <di:waypoint x="560" y="100" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_view_di" bpmnElement="flow_view">
        <di:waypoint x="270" y="270" />
        <di:waypoint x="270" y="230" />
        <di:waypoint x="380" y="230" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_view_end_di" bpmnElement="flow_view_end">
        <di:waypoint x="480" y="230" />
        <di:waypoint x="560" y="230" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_validate_di" bpmnElement="flow_validate">
        <di:waypoint x="270" y="320" />
        <di:waypoint x="270" y="360" />
        <di:waypoint x="380" y="360" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_validate_end_di" bpmnElement="flow_validate_end">
        <di:waypoint x="480" y="360" />
        <di:waypoint x="560" y="360" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_confirm_di" bpmnElement="flow_confirm">
        <di:waypoint x="270" y="320" />
        <di:waypoint x="270" y="490" />
        <di:waypoint x="380" y="490" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_confirm_end_di" bpmnElement="flow_confirm_end">
        <di:waypoint x="480" y="490" />
        <di:waypoint x="560" y="490" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
